    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d260">

                <pb facs="0480" n="470" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg470"/>

                <head>Mr. Howard to Mr.
                        Jackson.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">St. John,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 9, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>You are instructed by Secretary Seward to use your best efforts to secure
                    detention of Chesapeake and arrest of criminals. I now learn that she will
                    proceed to Shelburne.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. Q. HOWARD, <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
